'''Biogel''' is a [[:Category:Rare|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting the [[Hospital Egg]], the [[Bio Egg]], and the [[Zyleak Egg]] during the [[Easter Event 2023|2023 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
The spine of the blade is silver with a black clip attached to the back of it, two black screws, and a black outline separating it from the lime green edge. The guard and handle are both silver, but the handle has a black bolster and pommel with a silver screw on each of them.

== Trivia ==
*In players’ inventories, this knife is labeled as "Bio" instead of "Biogel". This also happens with the [[Nuclear]] gun where it is labeled as "Nuke" instead of "Nuclear".
*All the eggs needed to collect this knife are [[:Category:Rare|rare]] in rarity.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

